KNOWNBUG libcxx
visit.cpp
--cpp20 --stdlib libc++ --object-bits 12
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ visit: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
