dropped the body of system-header function
--
libc++ (LLVM 18) std::visit(F, variant<int, char>): main cannot be fully
type-checked, without any error outside a substitution context; with
libstdc++ 13 the body of std::visit is dropped.  Not reduced yet.  clang++ 18
-stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
